    "sections": {
        "description": "Personal Tutor is a structured theme designed for independent tutors, subject mentors, and small coaching centers seeking a clear and organized academic website. It provides defined sections for displaying courses, tutor profiles, class schedules, and student feedback, making it suitable for private tuition services, online classes, and broader education-related use cases. As a lightweight theme, it includes clean typography, structured content blocks, customizable header and footer options, and flexible layout settings that can also support simple elearning websites. The theme integrates with popular page builders and follows standard SEO-friendly coding practices, making it adaptable for LMS-based platforms or setups inspired by masterstudy-style layouts. It can also be used for projects that require a basic university-style structure with organized content presentation. Its responsive design ensures consistent readability across devices while maintaining stable performance and a straightforward user experience."
    },
